WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.193 --> 00:00:01.760
our students that were involved

00:00:01.893 --> 00:00:13.205
and also the suspect.

00:00:13.205 --> 00:00:15.340
&gt;&gt; Good morning.

00:00:15.473 --> 00:00:17.475
Deputy chief cris Ross man with

00:00:17.609 --> 00:00:21.213
the Michigan state police public

00:00:21.346 --> 00:00:21.546
safety.

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:22.247
As you can tell, it this has

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:23.215
been a long night for a lot of

00:00:23.215 --> 00:00:23.248
us.

00:00:23.381 --> 00:00:24.783
We have been committed from the

00:00:25.217 --> 00:00:26.585
beginning to being as

00:00:26.718 --> 00:00:29.221
transparent and getting as much

00:00:29.221 --> 00:00:31.556
information out as possible, and

00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:41.233
we are going to continue to do

00:00:41.233 --> 00:00:41.666
that throughout the day and as

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:43.235
this investigation moves

00:00:43.235 --> 00:00:43.301
forward.

00:00:43.435 --> 00:00:44.035
I am going to start with a brief

00:00:44.169 --> 00:00:44.769
recap of the incident yesterday.

00:00:44.903 --> 00:00:47.239
This tragic situation unfolded

00:00:47.239 --> 00:00:49.774
shortly before 8:30 P.M.

00:00:49.908 --> 00:00:55.413
The first call that we received

00:00:55.547 --> 00:00:57.449
was from Burkey hall, an

00:00:57.582 --> 00:00:59.251
academic building on the

00:00:59.251 --> 00:01:02.854
northern campus that borders

00:01:03.255 --> 00:01:03.822
downtown east lancing.

00:01:03.955 --> 00:01:05.690
Initial calls reported shots

00:01:05.824 --> 00:01:07.259
fired in that building and there

00:01:07.259 --> 00:01:09.995
was an absolutely overwhelming

00:01:10.128 --> 00:01:10.729
police response to that initial

00:01:10.862 --> 00:01:13.331
call.

00:01:13.465 --> 00:01:15.567
We had officers in that building

00:01:15.700 --> 00:01:18.870
within minutes.

00:01:19.271 --> 00:01:21.439
And in that building they

00:01:21.573 --> 00:01:22.173
encountered several students who

00:01:22.307 --> 00:01:25.277
were injured.

00:01:25.377 --> 00:01:30.048
We can confirm that two of the

00:01:30.181 --> 00:01:33.285
deceased were in Burkey hall.

00:01:33.285 --> 00:01:33.752
Along with several of the

00:01:33.885 --> 00:01:36.921
victims.

00:01:37.289 --> 00:01:39.291
While the officers were managing

00:01:39.357 --> 00:01:42.694
that scene at Burkey hall, we

00:01:42.827 --> 00:01:43.828
began receiving additional

00:01:43.962 --> 00:01:47.732
reports of another shooting at

00:01:47.866 --> 00:01:49.567
the msu union building just to

00:01:49.701 --> 00:01:52.070
the west of Burkey hall right on

00:01:52.203 --> 00:01:52.937
the corner of Abbott and grand

00:01:53.305 --> 00:01:56.241
river.

00:01:56.374 --> 00:01:58.310
Officers redeployed to that

00:01:58.443 --> 00:02:00.845
location where we did locate one

00:02:00.979 --> 00:02:10.322
additional victim.

00:02:10.455 --> 00:02:12.791
We have three deceased and five

00:02:12.924 --> 00:02:14.025
victims at the hospital.

00:02:14.159 --> 00:02:15.327
We can confirm all three

00:02:15.327 --> 00:02:18.463
deceased were msu students.

00:02:18.596 --> 00:02:20.732
We can also confirm at this time

00:02:20.865 --> 00:02:22.667
that all five of the injured

00:02:22.801 --> 00:02:24.135
victims at the hospital were

00:02:24.269 --> 00:02:30.608
also msu students.

00:02:30.742 --> 00:02:34.713
We will release the names of

00:02:34.846 --> 00:02:37.582
those students later today.

00:02:37.716 --> 00:02:39.351
Once we work through some

00:02:39.417 --> 00:02:41.353
notifications and make sure that

00:02:41.486 --> 00:02:42.921
the families are aware that we

00:02:43.355 --> 00:02:43.588
are going to release those

00:02:43.722 --> 00:02:46.324
names.

00:02:46.458 --> 00:02:49.494
The suspect in this case was

00:02:49.627 --> 00:02:50.862
located at approximately

00:02:50.995 --> 00:02:51.496
11:35 P.M. In the city of

00:02:51.629 --> 00:02:56.701
lancing.

00:02:56.835 --> 00:02:59.571
The suspect was located by units

00:02:59.704 --> 00:03:02.273
that were assisting in looking

00:03:02.407 --> 00:03:02.941
for that suspect after the

00:03:03.375 --> 00:03:06.077
shootings.

00:03:06.211 --> 00:03:10.882
The suspect is deceased due to a

00:03:11.015 --> 00:03:13.885
self-inflicted gunshot wound and

00:03:14.018 --> 00:03:14.619
we are prepared to release the

00:03:14.753 --> 00:03:16.020
name of the person who committed

00:03:16.154 --> 00:03:20.325
these homicides at this time.

00:03:20.458 --> 00:03:22.260
We have previously confirmed he

00:03:22.394 --> 00:03:25.463
was 43 years old, a male.

00:03:25.597 --> 00:03:29.434
His name is Anthony, last name

00:03:29.567 --> 00:03:35.807
is Mccray.

00:03:35.940 --> 00:03:36.141
Mcrae.

00:03:36.274 --> 00:03:40.678
Anthony dwyanecrae.

00:03:40.812 --> 00:03:40.979
Mcrae.

00:03:41.112 --> 00:03:43.548
Anthony Dwyane Mcrae.

00:03:43.681 --> 00:03:44.883
We would like to thank you or

00:03:45.016 --> 00:03:45.784
community for their help.

00:03:45.917 --> 00:03:50.989
Because of our quick release of

00:03:51.423 --> 00:03:51.990
the photograph from the campus

00:03:52.123 --> 00:03:55.994
security cameras and help from

00:03:56.127 --> 00:03:58.263
our community, it was a caller's

00:03:58.396 --> 00:03:59.564
tip that led law enforcement to

00:03:59.697 --> 00:04:00.231
that suspect in the city of

00:04:00.365 --> 00:04:02.634
lancing.

00:04:02.767 --> 00:04:04.602
We cannot thank the public and

00:04:04.736 --> 00:04:05.837
the community and the person who

00:04:05.970 --> 00:04:08.606
called in that report in enough

00:04:08.740 --> 00:04:10.208
for being observant, for

00:04:10.341 --> 00:04:15.447
following our messaging, and for

00:04:15.580 --> 00:04:16.714
being vigilant in contacting us

00:04:16.848 --> 00:04:27.926
immediately.

00:04:28.059 --> 00:04:30.862
We will continue to share

00:04:30.995 --> 00:04:33.531
resources for the msu community

00:04:33.665 --> 00:04:36.234
through our institutional

00:04:36.367 --> 00:04:38.570
website and our msu police and

00:04:38.703 --> 00:04:40.572
public safety social media

00:04:40.705 --> 00:04:40.872
pages.

00:04:41.005 --> 00:04:42.407
We know that this news may be

00:04:42.540 --> 00:04:44.843
difficult for those within our

00:04:44.976 --> 00:04:46.444
campus community and beyond and

00:04:46.578 --> 00:04:48.913
it's important to remember that

00:04:49.047 --> 00:04:49.581
some -- it's important to

00:04:49.714 --> 00:04:51.483
remember that the grief that

00:04:51.483 --> 00:04:52.951
some individuals may be

00:04:53.084 --> 00:04:54.085
experiencing is normal and there

00:04:54.219 --> 00:04:56.688
are a number of ways in which

00:04:56.821 --> 00:04:58.156
individuals can seek support,

00:04:58.289 --> 00:05:00.258
including talking with friends,

00:05:00.391 --> 00:05:01.626
family, and colleagues to

00:05:01.759 --> 00:05:03.862
process this, and taking

00:05:03.995 --> 00:05:04.496
advantage of many of the

00:05:04.629 --> 00:05:08.766
resources that we have provided.

00:05:08.900 --> 00:05:09.801
We are prepared at this point to

00:05:09.934 --> 00:05:16.975
take some questions.

00:05:17.108 --> 00:05:18.943
We will turn is over to special

00:05:19.077 --> 00:05:26.184
agent in charge, Jim.

00:05:26.317 --> 00:05:27.151
&gt;&gt; Good morning.

00:05:27.519 --> 00:05:27.886
I am the special agent in charge

00:05:28.019 --> 00:05:31.523
of the FBI in Michigan.

00:05:31.556 --> 00:05:34.359
First of all, our hearts go out

00:05:34.492 --> 00:05:37.962
to all of the victims, the

00:05:38.096 --> 00:05:39.797
families, the students in the

00:05:39.931 --> 00:05:41.533
community.

00:05:41.533 --> 00:05:45.537
This happens much too often.

00:05:45.537 --> 00:05:49.574
I'd like to thank our partners

00:05:49.707 --> 00:05:50.642
and law enforcement, chief, once

00:05:50.775 --> 00:05:52.744
again, thanks for your

00:05:52.877 --> 00:05:53.144
leadership.

00:05:53.545 --> 00:05:53.745
Just great examples of

00:05:53.878 --> 00:05:55.547
leadership last night from all

00:05:55.680 --> 00:05:58.016
of the agencies that showed up

00:05:58.149 --> 00:06:00.919
short notice and showed selfless

00:06:01.052 --> 00:06:03.054
sacrifice to attempt to

00:06:03.187 --> 00:06:04.355
identify, find the subject and

00:06:04.489 --> 00:06:07.859
eliminate the threat.

00:06:07.992 --> 00:06:09.794
Last night when this occurred,

00:06:09.928 --> 00:06:12.564
many agencies arrived on season.

00:06:12.697 --> 00:06:20.138
The FBI deployed agents,

00:06:20.271 --> 00:06:20.872
analysts, and specialty teams to

00:06:21.005 --> 00:06:24.208
help in the effort to help the

00:06:24.342 --> 00:06:37.889
victims and

00:06:38.022 --> 00:06:42.694
community at large to come

00:06:42.827 --> 00:06:44.362
together, and we will continue

00:06:44.495 --> 00:06:45.163
working in the future hand in

00:06:45.597 --> 00:06:47.065
hand to mitigate these threats

00:06:47.198 --> 00:06:49.267
and try to make Michigan as safe

00:06:49.601 --> 00:06:50.268
a place as we can for families.

00:06:50.401 --> 00:07:02.046
Thank you.

00:07:02.180 --> 00:07:04.515
&gt;&gt; We are prepared to take some

00:07:04.649 --> 00:07:04.882
questions.

00:07:05.016 --> 00:07:07.151
This is still fluid, still

00:07:07.285 --> 00:07:07.619
ongoing.

00:07:07.619 --> 00:07:08.319
There are still crime scenes

00:07:08.453 --> 00:07:09.687
being processed.

00:07:09.821 --> 00:07:11.756
And we still are in the process

00:07:11.889 --> 00:07:13.625
of putting together the pieces

00:07:13.625 --> 00:07:17.629
to try to solve -- to try to

00:07:17.629 --> 00:07:18.563
understand what happened and why

00:07:18.696 --> 00:07:19.797
it may have happened.

00:07:19.931 --> 00:07:21.265
So we're still working through

00:07:21.633 --> 00:07:21.699
that.

00:07:21.699 --> 00:07:22.700
So we will go ahead and take

00:07:22.834 --> 00:07:25.303
some questions at this time.

00:07:25.637 --> 00:07:25.770
&gt;&gt; Were seven --

00:07:25.903 --> 00:07:26.738
&gt;&gt; Hold on.

00:07:26.871 --> 00:07:27.639
&gt;&gt; Go ahead.

00:07:27.705 --> 00:07:28.940
&gt;&gt; Thank you.

00:07:29.073 --> 00:07:30.675
There was a large police

00:07:30.808 --> 00:07:33.945
presence on creston avenue in

00:07:34.078 --> 00:07:34.278
lancing.

00:07:34.412 --> 00:07:35.647
Was that the suspect's home?

00:07:35.647 --> 00:07:39.651
&gt;&gt; So I can't confirm the actual

00:07:39.651 --> 00:07:39.984
location or address.

00:07:40.118 --> 00:07:42.186
We are aware that there was a

00:07:42.320 --> 00:07:44.622
search warrant executed on a

00:07:44.756 --> 00:07:45.657
residence that was connected to

00:07:45.790 --> 00:07:47.058
the suspect in this case.

00:07:47.191 --> 00:07:48.760
We are not prepared share that

00:07:48.893 --> 00:07:50.361
specific location at this point.

00:07:50.495 --> 00:07:51.663
&gt;&gt; Do you have any information

00:07:51.696 --> 00:07:53.665
on the firearm and whether it

00:07:53.731 --> 00:07:55.099
was registered to the individual

00:07:55.233 --> 00:07:57.669
who is suspected of using it?

00:07:57.669 --> 00:07:59.103
&gt;&gt; At this point we have no

00:07:59.237 --> 00:08:00.004
additional information on the

00:08:00.138 --> 00:08:01.673
actual weapon used in the

00:08:01.673 --> 00:08:03.174
incident.

00:08:03.307 --> 00:08:03.875
Those are things that we will

00:08:04.008 --> 00:08:05.076
continue to process and look at

00:08:05.209 --> 00:08:06.411
today as part of our

00:08:06.544 --> 00:08:06.878
investigation.

00:08:07.011 --> 00:08:09.914
&gt;&gt; Did you recover the weapon?

00:08:10.048 --> 00:08:10.581
&gt;&gt; We did recover -- we did

00:08:10.715 --> 00:08:11.683
recover a weapon, yes.

00:08:11.749 --> 00:08:14.085
&gt;&gt; Seven of the eight victims

00:08:14.218 --> 00:08:16.421
are Berkey hall, the eighth at

00:08:16.554 --> 00:08:19.090
the union and the union victim

00:08:19.223 --> 00:08:19.691
passed away.

00:08:19.691 --> 00:08:22.460
Is that correct?

00:08:22.593 --> 00:08:24.996
&gt;&gt; There were two of the victims

00:08:25.129 --> 00:08:27.265
from Berkey hall are deceased.

00:08:27.699 --> 00:08:29.901
One victim from the union is

00:08:30.034 --> 00:08:30.268
deceased.

00:08:30.401 --> 00:08:31.703
There are five additional

00:08:31.703 --> 00:08:33.705
victims that are at sparrow

00:08:33.771 --> 00:08:34.005
hospital.

00:08:34.138 --> 00:08:36.307
I cannot confirm where all five

00:08:36.441 --> 00:08:37.842
of those victims, which building

00:08:37.975 --> 00:08:38.776
they were in.

00:08:39.077 --> 00:08:41.713
I believe most of them were from

00:08:41.813 --> 00:08:42.180
Berkey hall.

00:08:42.313 --> 00:08:44.816
I can't confirm that.

00:08:44.949 --> 00:08:45.349
&gt;&gt; Yes?

00:08:45.717 --> 00:08:48.853
&gt;&gt; I understand the first -- you

00:08:48.986 --> 00:08:51.089
said officers arrived shortly

00:08:51.222 --> 00:08:52.857
after the call.

00:08:52.990 --> 00:08:57.729
The second building, can you

00:08:57.829 --> 00:08:59.097
describe the tame table?

00:08:59.230 --> 00:09:01.966
Officers were [ inaudible ].

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:08.873
&gt;&gt; The msu union is within very

00:09:09.006 --> 00:09:09.741
close proximity to Berkey hall,

00:09:09.741 --> 00:09:10.208
within walking distance.

00:09:10.341 --> 00:09:11.743
I would describe it as less than

00:09:11.743 --> 00:09:13.044
a block to the west of Berkey

00:09:13.177 --> 00:09:13.344
hall.

00:09:13.745 --> 00:09:15.947
All indications at this point,

00:09:16.080 --> 00:09:17.782
point to the fact that the

00:09:17.915 --> 00:09:28.426
suspect exited Berky hall and

00:09:28.559 --> 00:09:29.127
walked over to the msu union.

00:09:29.260 --> 00:09:29.794
When those calls initially

00:09:29.927 --> 00:09:30.461
started coming in from the

00:09:30.595 --> 00:09:31.195
union, we were able to quickly

00:09:31.329 --> 00:09:31.929
redeploy resources to the union

00:09:32.063 --> 00:09:32.630
and the suspect quickly fled

00:09:32.764 --> 00:09:33.064
that building.

00:09:33.197 --> 00:09:34.031
He was not in the building for

00:09:34.165 --> 00:09:34.432
that long.

00:09:34.565 --> 00:09:36.267
&gt;&gt; When you say redeployed, how

00:09:36.400 --> 00:09:37.435
much of a timetable?

00:09:37.769 --> 00:09:38.636
&gt;&gt; I can't get into the

00:09:38.770 --> 00:09:40.204
specifics on the timeframe right

00:09:40.338 --> 00:09:42.373
now, but that will be part of

00:09:42.507 --> 00:09:43.341
the investigation that we will

00:09:43.775 --> 00:09:44.008
look as is the time between

00:09:44.142 --> 00:09:48.546
those two incidents.

00:09:48.679 --> 00:09:51.015
&gt;&gt; Has the suspect had previous

00:09:51.149 --> 00:09:51.783
interaction with law

00:09:51.783 --> 00:09:51.983
enforcement?

00:09:52.116 --> 00:09:52.750
&gt;&gt; That's part of our

00:09:52.884 --> 00:09:54.085
investigation today is to look

00:09:54.218 --> 00:09:56.487
at the suspect, his background,

00:09:56.621 --> 00:09:56.888
his history.

00:09:57.021 --> 00:09:58.756
Those are things that are

00:09:58.890 --> 00:09:59.957
occurring with our state and

00:10:00.091 --> 00:10:01.793
federal partners right now who

00:10:01.793 --> 00:10:04.629
have really taken the lead on

00:10:04.762 --> 00:10:06.731
helping us with identifying the

00:10:06.864 --> 00:10:08.432
suspect, especially since that

00:10:08.566 --> 00:10:10.134
incident did occur off campus.

00:10:10.268 --> 00:10:11.469
But those are things that we are

00:10:11.803 --> 00:10:13.171
looking at today and those will

00:10:13.304 --> 00:10:13.805
be integral to the

00:10:13.838 --> 00:10:17.809
investigation.

00:10:17.809 --> 00:10:19.377
&gt;&gt; Can you shed any light as to

00:10:19.811 --> 00:10:21.813
the why, why this happened?

00:10:21.946 --> 00:10:27.351
What his motive was?

00:10:27.485 --> 00:10:28.019
Why he chose Michigan state?

00:10:28.152 --> 00:10:28.820
&gt;&gt; We had the same question last

00:10:28.953 --> 00:10:29.821
night and we have the same

00:10:29.821 --> 00:10:30.688
answer this morning.

00:10:30.822 --> 00:10:31.823
We have absolutely no idea what

00:10:31.823 --> 00:10:33.858
the motive was at this point.

00:10:33.991 --> 00:10:37.829
We can confirm that the

00:10:37.962 --> 00:10:38.863
43-year-old suspect had no

00:10:38.996 --> 00:10:39.831
affiliation to the university.

00:10:39.831 --> 00:10:40.832
He was not a student, faculty,

00:10:40.965 --> 00:10:43.134
staff.

00:10:43.267 --> 00:10:46.637
Current or previous.

00:10:46.771 --> 00:10:48.806
So that's an unknown right now.

00:10:48.940 --> 00:10:51.209
And that's what we're trying to

00:10:51.342 --> 00:10:53.244
understand, is why this incident

